title: "Agentic Dynamics: An experimental instrument for the economics of agentic AI"
message: "If you use this instrument or dataset in your research, please cite it as follows."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Hugo
    family-names: Pepar
repository-code: "https://github.com/peparhugo/agentic-dynamics"
url: "https://ai-finops-rulebook.web.app"
abstract: "Success isn't value. An open experimental instrument that deliberately degrades engineering specifications, runs coding agents against them, and measures what happens to agent decisions, test-executed outcomes, cost, and durable value. 249 instrumented sessions across 8 model variants using 10 perturbation operators."
